# Unified shell is a single-page app using BrowserRouter. Deep links like
# /wordnew/learn or /pycore-manager/code-sync must fall back to index.html so
# the client router can resolve them (otherwise a static host 404s on refresh).
#
# This file is copied to the build root (dist/_redirects) and is honoured by
# Netlify-style hosts. For other servers, configure the equivalent SPA fallback:
#   - Vite dev / `vite preview`: handled automatically (no config).
#   - nginx:   try_files $uri /index.html;
#   - Apache:  FallbackResource /index.html
#   - Laravel: Route::fallback(fn () => response()->file(public_path('index.html')));
